# 基本文章編集の検索/置換: the desktop's own and the process put up the same panel, find the
# same letters and write the same record (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. Two copies of
# 基本文章編集 with 30 paragraphs (mkbig doc 30): the caret put at the head of the text,
# 検索/置換 opened with Ctrl+F, ABC typed into 検索文字列 and Enter (次を検索): the first ABC
# is picked, and Delete throws it away; then saved. Record 0 of both must be the same, byte
# for byte; the shots of the panel up (doc_find_k_panel, doc_find_p_panel) are compared
# afterwards where the panel stands (140,160 to 660,460), and the text after (101,125 to
# 682,482). While the desktop's panel is up the desktop answers no sync.
# Keys: Enter 28, Delete 4C; Ctrl+F 09 01, Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
mkbig doc 30
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 111 135
sync 600
key 09 01
wait 1000
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_find_k_panel
text ABC
wait 300
key 28
wait 800
sync 600
key 4C
sync 600
click 111 135
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_find_k_done
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
click 111 135
expectsince document: drew
logmark
key 09 01
expectsince document: find panel open
wait 1000
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_find_p_panel
text ABC
wait 300
logmark
key 28
expectsince document: find panel answered
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
logmark
key 4C
expectsince document: key to screen
logmark
click 111 135
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_find_p_done
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
key 08 01
expect document: closed
